WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,180 --> 00:00:04,580
your name is white teeth

2
00:00:04,580 --> 00:00:05,980
From now on he will be my war bug.

3
00:00:05,980 --> 00:00:06,980
Keep up the good work

4
00:00:06,980 --> 00:00:08,980
Don't take off your hind legs, little one

5
00:00:08,980 --> 00:00:10,960
white teeth white teeth

6
00:00:10,960 --> 00:00:12,460
You need to get better soon

7
00:00:12,460 --> 00:00:13,460
Wait until you get better

8
00:00:13,460 --> 00:00:18,130
Let's go out and hunt bison together.

9
00:00:18,130 --> 00:00:20,130
White Fang is not in any danger for the time being.

10
00:00:20,130 --> 00:00:23,320
Go back and feed her some meat or something, senior

11
00:00:23,320 --> 00:00:24,820
Then we still go to chop down trees?

12
00:00:24,820 --> 00:00:26,050
Not going

13
00:00:26,050 --> 00:00:27,850
The wolves have probably gone to that place.

14
00:00:27,850 --> 00:00:29,850
We don't have to fight those wolves

15
00:00:29,850 --> 00:00:31,050
I have eaten enough now

16
00:00:31,050 --> 00:00:32,050
wooden house two stars

17
00:00:32,050 --> 00:00:33,650
It’s not like you can upgrade just because you want to.

18
00:00:33,650 --> 00:00:34,850
Need a lot of things

19
00:00:34,850 --> 00:00:37,850
We might as well spend these two days growing vegetables and exchanging resources.

20
00:00:37,850 --> 00:00:39,850
It’s not too late to cut down the trees after the wolves have gone away.

21
00:00:39,850 --> 00:00:43,800
good senior

22
00:00:43,800 --> 00:00:45,800
Oh, okay, I can leave so quickly
